      "message": "This seems like a general problem with `j.Stem()`, and not something that should only be fixed here.  Unfortunately that gets a little tricky, because `j.Stem()` is called from outside the modules\u0027 ModuleContext (in androidmk.go, which is called from a Singleton, and in `gatherPossibleApexModuleNamesAndStems`, which calls it on dependencies.  I think the right solution is to compute the stem once early in `GenerateAndroidBuildActions` based on `ctx.ModuleName()` instead of `Name()`, and store it for return by `j.Stem()`.",
